      K₀ hπK₀ A₀ ι hι hιK₀ hres ϖ₀ hϖ₀ hϖ₀π F₀ hF₀ hjF₀ hj₀' X₀ toBase₀ hN₀ φ₀ hM₀ hdim gen hpinIg hpinSS hgen_sp hgen_iff

  have hsm_of_chart : ∀ (B : Subalgebra A₀ ↥F₀) (𝔪 : Ideal ↥B) (_ : 𝔪.IsMaximal) (x₀ : X₀),
      B.FG → (∀ x : ↥F₀, _root_.IsIntegral ↥B x → x ∈ B) →
