  refine ⟨X₀, toBase₀, iInt₀, iProp₀, iFlat₀, iLfp₀, F₀, hF₀algI, φ₀, hF₀, ?_, hN₀, hO₀, hG₀, hdim, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩
